{
  "paraphrase": "For all functions d from natural numbers to natural numbers and for all integers S, if d is defined as the sum over the digits of n in base 2 of their factorials, and S is defined as the sum from k equals 1 to 2020 of (-1) raised to the power of d(k) multiplied by k cubed, then S modulo 2020 equals putnam_2020_b1_solution."
}
